WEBVTT

00:09.277 --> 00:10.511
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.578 --> 00:12.346
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.413 --> 00:13.914
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.981 --> 00:15.616
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.683 --> 00:18.819
* OH... *
* 哦... *

00:18.886 --> 00:20.888
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.954 --> 00:22.890
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.956 --> 00:25.193
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.259 --> 00:26.794
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.860 --> 00:28.996
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.063 --> 00:30.464
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.531 --> 00:33.033
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.101 --> 00:34.868
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.935 --> 00:36.804
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.870 --> 00:39.807
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:39.873 --> 00:40.841
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:40.908 --> 00:43.277
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:43.344 --> 00:45.613
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.679 --> 00:49.117
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.183 --> 00:51.085
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:06.200 --> 01:09.670
HAPPY VALENTINE'S DAY,
BIKINI BOTTOM!
情人节快乐，
比基尼泳裤！

01:24.752 --> 01:25.753
( crash )
（ 碰撞 ）

01:42.870 --> 01:45.005
HAPPY VALENTINE'S DAY,
SPONGEBOB.
情人节快乐，
海绵宝宝。

01:45.072 --> 01:47.175
I'M NUTS FOR YOU.
我为你疯狂。

01:48.242 --> 01:50.178
WELL, I'M BUBBLES
FOR YOU, SANDY.
好吧，我是泡泡
为了你，桑迪。

01:55.483 --> 01:57.885
MMM, CHOCOLATE.
嗯，巧克力。

01:57.951 --> 01:59.220
MIGHTY TASTY.
非常美味。

01:59.287 --> 02:03.724
PATRICK'S GOING TO LOVE
THE ONE YOU MADE FOR HIM.
帕特里克会喜欢的
您为他打造的一款。

02:03.791 --> 02:05.493
TAKE ME THROUGH
THE PLAN AGAIN.
带我了解一下
再次计划。

02:05.559 --> 02:06.560
OKAY.
好的。

02:08.929 --> 02:12.300
STEP ONE: PATRICK AND I GET TO
THE VALENTINE'S DAY CARNIVAL.
第一步：帕特里克和我开始
情人节狂欢节。

02:12.366 --> 02:16.470
STEP TWO: I POSITION
PATRICK AND MYSELF
ON TOP OF THE FERRIS WHEEL.
第二步：我的定位
帕特里克和我自己
在摩天轮的顶部。

02:18.672 --> 02:23.211
STEP THREE: YOU ARRIVE
AT DESIGNATED CHECKPOINT
FOR MAXIMUM VISUAL CONTACT.
第三步：您到达
在指定检查站
为了最大程度的视觉接触。

02:23.211 --> 02:25.045
STEP FOUR: PATRICK IS THRILLED.
第四步：帕特里克很兴奋。

02:25.112 --> 02:26.414
MISSION ACCOMPLISHED.
使命完成。

02:29.717 --> 02:31.219
( grunting... )
（咕哝……）

02:34.388 --> 02:35.556
HI, PATRICK.
嗨，帕特里克。

02:36.924 --> 02:38.025
HELLO?
你好？

02:38.091 --> 02:39.760
PATRICK,
IT'S ME, SPONGEBOB.
帕特里克，
是我，海绵宝宝。

02:39.827 --> 02:42.263
SPONGEBOB, WHAT ARE YOU
DOING IN THERE?
海绵宝宝，你是谁
在那里做什么？

02:42.330 --> 02:43.264
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

02:43.331 --> 02:44.798
OH MY GOSH! SPONGE...
天哪！海绵...

02:44.865 --> 02:47.368
SPONGEBOB IS STUCK
INSIDE THIS ROCK.
海绵宝宝被卡住了
在这块岩石里面。

02:47.435 --> 02:48.769
OH, HOLD ON, BUDDY!
哦，坚持住，伙计！

02:48.836 --> 02:50.103
I'LL GET YOU OUT!
我会带你出去的！

02:51.839 --> 02:53.774
SPONGEBOB?
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？
海绵宝宝？

02:53.841 --> 02:54.775
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

02:54.842 --> 02:55.843
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

02:55.909 --> 02:58.011
( weeping ):
SPONGEBOB...!
（哭泣）：
海绵宝宝...！

02:58.078 --> 03:00.648
PATRICK, I'M RIGHT
BEHIND YOU.
帕特里克，我是对的
在你身后。

03:00.714 --> 03:01.882
THERE YOU ARE.
你就在那里。

03:01.949 --> 03:03.484
HAPPY VALENTINE'S DAY.
情人节快乐。

03:03.551 --> 03:04.985
HERE'S YOUR PRESENT.
这是你的礼物。

03:05.052 --> 03:07.087
AND I HAVE A PRESENT FOR YOU.
我有一份礼物给你。

03:07.154 --> 03:08.121
YOU DO?
你做？

03:08.256 --> 03:09.557
IT'S THE GREATEST...
这是最伟大的...

03:09.623 --> 03:10.624
OH...!
哦...！

03:10.691 --> 03:11.892
THE BESTEST...
最好的...

03:11.959 --> 03:12.793
OH...!
哦...！

03:12.860 --> 03:14.895
THE MOST FANTABULOUS...
最梦幻的...

03:14.962 --> 03:15.729
OH...!
哦...！

03:15.796 --> 03:17.265
...PRESENT EVER!
...永远存在！

03:17.331 --> 03:18.632
OH... OOH... OH...!
哦...哦...哦...！

03:18.699 --> 03:20.501
BUT YOU CAN'T
HAVE IT YET.
但你不能
HAVE IT YET.

03:20.568 --> 03:22.403
HUH? WHY NOT?
嗯？为什么不呢？

03:22.470 --> 03:23.837
'CAUSE IT'S NOT READY YET.
因为它还没有准备好。

03:23.904 --> 03:25.273
IS IT READY NOW?
NOT YET.
现在准备好了吗？
还没有。

03:25.273 --> 03:26.307
HOW ABOUT NOW?
现在怎么样？

03:26.374 --> 03:28.609
DO YOU WANT TO
RUIN THE SURPRISE?
你想要吗
破坏惊喜？

03:28.676 --> 03:29.277
YES!
是的！

03:29.343 --> 03:30.278
UH-UH-UH.
呃-呃-呃。

03:30.344 --> 03:32.713
COME ON, PLEASE.
来吧，请。

03:32.780 --> 03:34.548
HMM...
唔...

03:34.615 --> 03:35.716
NOPE, SORRY.
不，抱歉。

03:35.783 --> 03:38.051
YOU GOT TO TELL ME!
你必须告诉我！

03:38.118 --> 03:39.620
NO CAN DO. ( laughs )
没有办法。 （笑）

03:39.687 --> 03:41.555
YOU'LL JUST HAVE TO WAIT.
您只需要等待。

03:41.622 --> 03:42.856
PLEASE...!
请...！

03:42.923 --> 03:43.991
OH, PLEASE, PLEASE.
哦，拜托，拜托。

03:44.057 --> 03:45.393
PLEASE, PLEASE, PLEASE.
拜托，拜托，拜托。

03:45.459 --> 03:47.561
TELL ME, TELL ME, TELL ME...
PLEASE!
告诉我，告诉我，告诉我......
请！

03:47.628 --> 03:50.331
OKAY, PATRICK,
HERE WE ARE.
好吧，帕特里克，
我们在这里。

03:50.398 --> 03:54.368
( gasps )
YOU GOT ME A CARNIVAL?!
（喘气）
你给我一个嘉年华？！

03:54.435 --> 03:56.370
MINE!
矿！

03:56.437 --> 03:57.505
ALL MINE, MINE, MINE.
都是我的，我的，我的。

03:57.571 --> 03:59.573
MINE, MINE, MINE.
我的，我的，我的。

03:59.640 --> 04:01.542
ALL RIGHT, EVERYBODY OUT!
好了，大家都出去！

04:01.609 --> 04:03.043
THIS IS MY CARNIVAL!
这是我的狂欢节！

04:03.110 --> 04:04.745
IT'S NOT THE CARNIVAL.
这不是嘉年华。

04:04.812 --> 04:06.079
OH.
哦。

04:06.146 --> 04:08.081
HERE, TAKE THIS QUARTER AND...
在这里，以本季度为例......

04:08.148 --> 04:09.483
OH MY GOSH, A QUARTER!
天哪，四分之一！

04:09.550 --> 04:11.319
I'VE ALWAYS WANTED A QUARTER.
我一直想要四分之一。

04:11.385 --> 04:12.686
IT'S NOT THE QUARTER.
这不是季度。

04:12.753 --> 04:13.687
OH.
哦。

04:13.754 --> 04:15.155
NOW, TAKE THAT QUARTER
现在，以该季度为例

04:15.222 --> 04:16.924
AND BUY SOME COTTON CANDY.
并买一些棉花糖。

04:16.990 --> 04:19.092
COTTON CANDY,
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT!
棉花糖，
我简直不敢相信！

04:19.159 --> 04:20.328
COTTON CANDY!
棉花糖！

04:20.328 --> 04:21.429
Man:
GET AWAY.
男士：
走开。

04:21.495 --> 04:23.030
Sandy to SpongeBob...
桑迪对海绵宝宝...

04:23.096 --> 04:24.332
Sandy to SpongeBob.
桑迪对海绵宝宝。

04:24.398 --> 04:25.633
Come in, SpongeBob.
进来吧，海绵宝宝。

04:25.699 --> 04:27.868
TEN-FOUR, SANDY, SPONGEBOB HERE.
十点四，桑迪，海绵宝宝在这里。

04:27.935 --> 04:30.371
I GOT A VISUAL...
WANT ME TO BRING HER IN?
我看到了……
要我带她进来吗？

04:30.438 --> 04:31.839
OH, NOT YET, SANDY.
哦，还没有，桑迪。

04:31.905 --> 04:35.476
PATRICK'S STILL TRYING TO GUESS
WHAT HIS VALENTINE IS.
帕特里克仍在尝试猜测
他的情人节礼物是什么？

04:35.543 --> 04:37.711
You are such a kidder.
Sandy out.
你真是个小孩子。
桑迪出来了

04:37.778 --> 04:39.146
THAT SPONGEBOB.
那个海绵宝宝。

04:39.212 --> 04:40.614
( clattering )
（咔哒声）

04:42.215 --> 04:43.384
SCALLOPS.
扇贝。

04:44.352 --> 04:46.086
CHOCOLATE-EATING SCALLOPS!
吃巧克力的扇贝！

04:46.153 --> 04:49.590
SO, IF IT'S NOT
COTTON CANDY,
THEN WHAT IS IT?
所以，如果不是
棉花糖，
那么它是什么？

04:49.657 --> 04:50.891
I CAN'T TAKE IT!
我受不了！

04:50.958 --> 04:52.593
YOU'LL HAVE TO GUESS.
你必须猜测。

04:52.660 --> 04:53.594
THIS TENT.
这个帐篷。

04:53.661 --> 04:54.261
NO.
不。

04:54.362 --> 04:56.029
THIS GUY?
这个家伙？

04:56.096 --> 04:57.398
NO.
不。

04:59.367 --> 05:01.101
THIS PARAMECIUM?
这个草履虫？

05:01.168 --> 05:02.703
( laughs ) NOPE.
（笑）不。

05:02.770 --> 05:03.871
( chuckles )
（笑声）

05:03.937 --> 05:05.773
YOU'RE A SLY ONE.
你是个狡猾的人。

05:05.839 --> 05:09.643
I CAN'T FIND IT
HERE IN THE CARNIVAL
我找不到它
在嘉年华

05:09.710 --> 05:13.481
BECAUSE IT'S ON TOP
OF MOUNT CLIMB-UP-
AND-FALL-OFF!
因为它在上面
爬山-
然后-脱落！

05:13.547 --> 05:14.882
( panting... )
（气喘吁吁……）

05:16.049 --> 05:17.217
( screams )
（尖叫声）

05:18.886 --> 05:20.888
IT WASN'T THERE,
EITHER.
它不在那里，
要么。

05:20.954 --> 05:23.223
ARE YOU SURE?
你确定吗？

05:23.290 --> 05:24.458
UH...
( panting )
呃……
（气喘吁吁）

05:24.525 --> 05:25.959
Sandy to Spongebob.
桑迪到海绵宝宝。

05:26.026 --> 05:27.495
SPONGEBOB TO SANDY.
海绵宝宝对桑迪。

05:27.561 --> 05:29.463
YOU CAN BRING IT IN NOW.
您现在就可以把它带进来。

05:29.530 --> 05:31.565
SPONGEBOB, WE'VE GOT
A LITTLE PROBLEM.
海绵宝宝，我们有
一个小问题。

05:31.632 --> 05:35.569
I GOT A PACK OF
CHOCOLATE-EATING SCALLOPS
TRYING TO RUSTLE THE BALLOON.
我有一包
巧克力扇贝
试图让气球发出沙沙声。

05:35.636 --> 05:37.871
GET AWAY,
YOU SWEET-TOOTHED VARMINTS!
走开，
你们这些爱吃甜食的恶棍！

05:37.938 --> 05:39.306
( yelling )
（大喊）

05:39.407 --> 05:41.141
I'm going to be a little late.
我会迟到一点。

05:41.208 --> 05:42.142
LATE?
晚的？

05:42.209 --> 05:43.143
BUT WHAT ABOUT...
但那又怎样呢...

05:43.210 --> 05:44.177
( screams )
（尖叫声）

05:44.244 --> 05:45.413
PATRICK?
帕特里克？

05:45.413 --> 05:46.514
( yelling )
（大喊）

05:46.580 --> 05:48.181
Take him up
to the Ferris Wheel
把他抱起来
前往摩天轮

05:48.248 --> 05:49.550
and I'll meet you there.
我会在那里见到你。

05:49.617 --> 05:50.784
Sandy out. ( yelling )
桑迪出来了（大喊）

05:50.851 --> 05:52.920
IF PATRICK DOESN'T GET
HIS VALENTINE...
如果帕特里克没有得到
他的情人节...

05:52.986 --> 05:56.023
I'M PRETTY SURE IT'S NOT UP
THERE, SPONGEBOB!
( screams )
我很确定还没有起来
在那里，海绵宝宝！
（尖叫声）

05:56.089 --> 05:59.259
PATRICK! ACTUALLY
IT'S ON THE FERRIS...
帕特里克！实际上
在摩天轮上...

05:59.326 --> 06:00.761
FERRIS WHEEL!
摩天轮！

06:00.828 --> 06:02.730
( panting... )
（气喘吁吁……）

06:02.796 --> 06:05.866
I'M READY FOR THE GREATEST
VALENTINE PRESENT
我已准备好迎接最伟大的时刻
VALENTINE PRESENT

06:05.933 --> 06:08.301
IN THE WHOLE WORLD NOW,
SPONGEBOB.
IN THE WHOLE WORLD NOW,
海绵宝宝。

06:08.436 --> 06:12.039
WELL, THIS IS WHERE
YOU'RE GOING TO GET IT...
I HOPE.
WELL, THIS IS WHERE
你会得到它...
我希望。

06:12.105 --> 06:14.475
JUST KEEP LOOKING
OUT THERE, PAL.
继续寻找
在那里，朋友。

06:17.144 --> 06:20.247
OH... OOH...
哦...哦...

06:20.313 --> 06:23.684
SPONGEBOB TO SANDY,
SPONGEBOB TO SANDY.
海绵宝宝对桑迪，
海绵宝宝对桑迪。

06:23.751 --> 06:24.785
Come in, Sandy.
进来吧，桑迪。

06:24.852 --> 06:26.219
SANDY TO SPONGEBOB.
桑迪对海绵宝宝。

06:26.286 --> 06:28.355
I GOT MY OX IN A HITCH HERE.
我的牛在这里遇到麻烦了。

06:28.456 --> 06:29.890
I'M WAY OFF COURSE.
我偏离了路线。

06:29.957 --> 06:31.158
( yelling )
（大喊）

06:31.224 --> 06:33.160
THE SCALLOPS ARE
EATING THE BALLOON!
扇贝是
吃气球！

06:33.226 --> 06:34.695
( yelling )
（大喊）

06:34.762 --> 06:35.896
THEY'RE EVERYWHERE!
他们无处不在！

06:35.963 --> 06:37.064
HUH?
嗯？

06:37.130 --> 06:38.699
OH, SHOOT!
哦，开枪！

06:38.766 --> 06:40.968
WE'RE GOING DOWN, SPONGEBOB.
我们要下去了，海绵宝宝。

06:41.034 --> 06:42.369
SWITCH TO PLAN B.
切换到 B 计划。

06:42.470 --> 06:46.239
NO B, SANDY, NO B. NO!
不，桑迪，不，不！

06:46.306 --> 06:48.041
OH...
哦...

06:48.108 --> 06:49.810
UH, PATRICK,
YOU KNOW HOW
呃，帕特里克，
你知道怎么做

06:49.877 --> 06:52.379
SOMETIMES YOU PLAN
SOMETHING SPECIAL
有时你计划
特别的东西

06:52.480 --> 06:54.582
AND THINGS JUST
DON'T WORK OUT?
事情就这样
不锻炼？

06:54.648 --> 06:58.285
NO, NO... OH, GEE...
不，不……哦，天啊……

06:58.351 --> 06:59.687
OH, HOLY MACKEREL.
哦，神圣的鲭鱼。

06:59.753 --> 07:01.789
IS IT HOT UP HERE
OR WHAT?!
这里热吗？
或者什么？！

07:01.855 --> 07:03.624
VALENTINE, VALENTINE...
情人节，情人节……

07:03.691 --> 07:05.358
HUH? NO...
NO, PATRICK!
嗯？不...
不，帕特里克！

07:05.493 --> 07:08.361
Patrick:
VALENTINE, VALENTINE,
VALENTINE...
帕特里克：
情人节，情人节，
情人节...

07:08.496 --> 07:10.030
VALENTINE, VALENTINE...
情人节，情人节……

07:10.097 --> 07:11.131
PATRICK, DON'T!
帕特里克，不要！

07:11.198 --> 07:14.101
( grunting and yelling )
（咕哝和大喊）

07:15.503 --> 07:16.670
PATRICK! HERE IT IS!
帕特里克！这里是！

07:20.340 --> 07:21.775
WHAT'S THAT?
那是什么？

07:21.842 --> 07:24.612
A HANDSHAKE,
A FRIENDLY HANDSHAKE.
握手，
友好的握手。

07:24.678 --> 07:26.113
A HANDSHAKE?
握手？

07:26.179 --> 07:27.948
THAT'S THE BIG GIFT?
这是一份大礼物？

07:28.015 --> 07:30.350
YOU GOT ME A HANDSHAKE?
你跟我握手了吗？

07:30.417 --> 07:32.119
A FRIENDLY HANDSHAKE.
友好的握手。

07:32.185 --> 07:34.354
HAPPY VALENTINE'S DAY!
情人节快乐！

07:39.960 --> 07:41.629
( laughs nervously )
（紧张地笑）

08:14.962 --> 08:18.131
( sighs deeply )
（深深叹息）

08:18.198 --> 08:19.867
I'VE BEEN THINKING.
我一直在想。

08:19.933 --> 08:22.269
AT FIRST A HANDSHAKE
DOESN'T SEEM LIKE MUCH
首先握手
看起来不太像

08:22.335 --> 08:24.772
BUT... REALLY IT'S
THE THOUGHT THAT COUNTS.
但是...真的是这样
重要的想法。

08:24.838 --> 08:28.842
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
I JUST WANTED TO THANK YOU
FOR THIS BOX OF CHOCOLATES.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
我只是想谢谢你
对于这盒巧克力。

08:28.909 --> 08:30.077
UH, NO PROBLEM, FRAN.
呃，没问题，弗兰。

08:30.143 --> 08:32.445
I MEAN, EVEN THOUGH
I WAS EXPECTING MORE...
我的意思是，尽管如此
我期待更多...

08:32.580 --> 08:34.214
THANKS FOR THE ROSES,
SPONGEBOB.
谢谢你的玫瑰，
海绵宝宝。

08:34.281 --> 08:35.482
HAPPY VALENTINE'S DAY.
情人节快乐。

08:35.583 --> 08:36.950
YOU TOO, DAVE.
你也是，戴夫。

08:37.017 --> 08:39.887
NOT THAT IT MATTERS THAT WE'VE
BEEN FRIENDS FOR SO LONG...
重要的是我们已经
已经是好朋友这么久了...

08:39.953 --> 08:41.689
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
THANKS FOR
THE BIKE.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
感谢
自行车。

08:41.755 --> 08:43.456
CAN YOU BELIEVE
THIS GUY?
你能相信吗
这个家伙？

08:43.591 --> 08:45.458
I JUST MET HIM
THIS MORNING.
我刚认识他
今天早上。

08:45.593 --> 08:47.027
SO, AS I WAS SAYING...
所以，正如我所说...

08:47.094 --> 08:49.630
EXCUSE ME, DO YOU GUYS
HAVE THE TIME?
对不起，你们好吗？
有时间吗？

08:49.697 --> 08:50.798
( screaming )
（尖叫）

08:50.864 --> 08:54.635
OOH, PATRICK
NEEDS LOVE, TOO!
哦，帕特里克
也需要爱！

08:54.702 --> 08:58.138
OOH...!
哦...！

08:58.205 --> 09:01.341
( panting, yelling
and screaming... )
（气喘吁吁、大喊大叫
并尖叫……）

09:03.376 --> 09:06.046
( yelling )
（大喊）

09:06.113 --> 09:09.016
I DEFY YOU, HEART MAN!
我违抗你，好心人！

09:09.082 --> 09:10.117
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:10.183 --> 09:11.719
Attention, everyone.
大家注意了。

09:11.785 --> 09:14.121
There's a chubby pink starfish
on the loose!
有一只胖乎乎的粉色海星
逍遥法外！

09:14.187 --> 09:15.455
( all screaming )
（大家尖叫）

09:15.522 --> 09:17.524
( gibbering... )
（胡言乱语……）

09:20.961 --> 09:25.265
HEART ON STICK MUST DIE!
棍棒上的心必须死！

09:25.332 --> 09:27.400
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:27.467 --> 09:30.470
( grunting and screaming... )
（咕哝和尖叫……）

09:38.178 --> 09:40.180
( panting... )
（气喘吁吁……）

09:40.247 --> 09:43.984
HEART ON STICK MUST DIE!
棍棒上的心必须死！

09:44.051 --> 09:45.719
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:45.786 --> 09:47.320
( munching )
（咀嚼）

09:47.387 --> 09:48.956
( gasps ) PATRICK!
（喘气）帕特里克！

09:49.022 --> 09:51.925
( gibbering )
（胡言乱语）

09:51.992 --> 09:54.094
( all scream )
（大家尖叫）

09:56.864 --> 09:58.065
( howling )
（嚎叫）

10:00.901 --> 10:05.172
GIVE ME SPONGEBOB!
给我海绵宝宝！

10:05.238 --> 10:06.674
( laughs nervously )
（紧张地笑）

10:06.740 --> 10:08.275
YOU BROKE MY HEART!
你伤了我的心！

10:08.341 --> 10:11.812
NOW I'M GOING TO BREAK
SOMETHING OF YOURS!
现在我要打破了
你的东西！

10:11.879 --> 10:16.549
OKAY, PATRICK, I KNOW
I DESERVE THIS, BUT DO THEY?
好吧，帕特里克，我知道
我应得的，但他们也应得的吗？

10:16.616 --> 10:19.820
THEY DIDN'T GIVE ME
ANYTHING, EITHER.
他们没有给我
任何事情，都可以。

10:19.887 --> 10:23.223
NOPE, IT'S TOO LATE
FOR THAT NOW...
不，太晚了
现在……

10:23.290 --> 10:26.727
FOR ALL OF YOU.
为了你们所有人。

10:26.794 --> 10:29.529
( growling... )
（咆哮……）

10:33.000 --> 10:34.067
( screaming )
（尖叫）

10:34.134 --> 10:35.368
YEE-HA!
是啊哈！

10:35.435 --> 10:37.370
GET ALONG, LITTLE SHELLFISH.
相处吧，小贝类。

10:37.437 --> 10:39.139
GIDDAP, YOU SCALLOPS!
天哪，你这个扇贝！

10:39.206 --> 10:41.574
SpongeBob:
YEAH, SANDY'S HERE!
海绵宝宝：
是的，桑迪在这里！

10:41.641 --> 10:45.378
WHOO-HOO! LOOK, PATRICK,
IT'S HERE! IT'S HERE!
呼呼！看，帕特里克，
就在这里！就在这里！

10:45.445 --> 10:49.049
THE BEST VALENTINE IN THE WHOLE
WIDE WORLD IS RIGHT BEHIND YOU!
最好的情人节
广阔的世界就在您身后！

10:49.116 --> 10:50.617
SURE IT IS.
当然是。

10:50.684 --> 10:54.121
I'M TELLING YOU IT'S
RIGHT THERE. TURN AROUND!
我告诉你它是
就在那里。回转！

10:54.187 --> 10:54.922
UH-UH.
呃-呃。

10:54.988 --> 10:56.456
PATRICK, TURN AROUND.
帕特里克，转过身来。

10:57.457 --> 10:58.926
All:
TURN AROUND!
全部：
转身！

10:58.992 --> 11:02.062
Man:
HEY, NINCOMPOOP,
TURN AROUND!
男士：
嘿，宁康普，
转身！

11:02.129 --> 11:04.497
YOU MUST THINK
I'M PRETTY DUMB, HUH?
你必须思考
我很笨，是吧？

11:04.564 --> 11:07.467
Crowd:
YES! TURN AROUND!
人群：
是的！回转！

11:07.534 --> 11:08.869
NO.
不。

11:08.936 --> 11:11.739
( chanting ):
TURN AROUND, TURN AROUND.
（念诵）：
转身，转身。

11:11.805 --> 11:12.740
NUH-UH.
努-呃。

11:12.806 --> 11:14.541
I'M GOING TO SAY THIS ONCE
我要说一次

11:14.607 --> 11:18.111
AND I'M NOT GOING TO SAY IT
AGAIN, SO PAY ATTENTION.
我不会说出来
再次强调，请注意。

11:18.178 --> 11:20.147
I AM NOT, I REPEAT
我不是，我再说一遍

11:20.213 --> 11:23.083
NOT GOING TO TURN AROUND
FOR ANY REASON EVER.
不会回头
出于任何原因。

11:23.150 --> 11:24.818
Sandy:
HOWDY, PATRICK!
桑迪：
你好，帕特里克！

11:24.885 --> 11:27.220
HI, SANDY. ( gasps )
嗨，桑迪。 （喘气）

11:28.956 --> 11:31.358
( mumbling... )
（咕哝着……）

11:31.424 --> 11:33.861
HAPPY VALENTINE'S
DAY, PATRICK.
情人节快乐
天，帕特里克。

11:33.927 --> 11:35.162
YAY!
耶！

11:35.228 --> 11:39.666
YAY! MY VALENTINE!
耶！我的情人节！

11:39.767 --> 11:42.669
HEY, IS THIS SOLID CHOCOLATE?
嘿，这是固体巧克力吗？

11:42.770 --> 11:43.837
PATRICK, NO!
帕特里克，不！

11:43.904 --> 11:46.206
( chomp, explosion )
（咀嚼、爆炸）

11:46.273 --> 11:49.810
Patrick:
OH, SPONGEBOB...
帕特里克：
哦，海绵宝宝...

11:49.877 --> 11:52.612
YOU DIDN'T HAVE TO
GIVE ME ANYTHING.
你不必这样做
给我任何东西。

12:09.396 --> 12:11.598
( humming... )
（哼哼……）

12:15.335 --> 12:18.005
AH... TIME TO RELAX.
啊……放松一下的时间到了。

12:29.516 --> 12:30.450
( gasps )
（喘气）

12:30.517 --> 12:31.718
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

12:31.819 --> 12:34.521
WELL, TIME TO GO.
好了，该出发了。

12:34.587 --> 12:37.424
SQUIDWARD!
SQUIDWARD, WAIT!
章鱼哥！
章鱼哥，等等！

12:37.490 --> 12:38.525
NOW WHAT?
现在怎么办？

12:38.591 --> 12:40.093
YOU DROPPED THIS
PIECE OF PAPER.
你把这个掉了
一张纸。

12:40.160 --> 12:41.561
YEAH, SO WHAT?
是啊，那又怎样？

12:41.628 --> 12:44.231
I JUST FIGURED YOU
PROBABLY WANT IT BACK.
我刚刚想到了你
可能想要回来。

12:44.297 --> 12:45.565
WHAT'S THE BIG DEAL?
有什么大不了的？

12:45.632 --> 12:46.733
IT'S ONLY GARBAGE.
这只是垃圾。

12:46.834 --> 12:47.901
GARBAGE?!
垃圾？！

12:47.968 --> 12:50.270
BUT, SQUIDWARD,
IN THE RIGHT HANDS
但是，章鱼哥，
在正确的人手中

12:50.337 --> 12:53.240
THIS PAPER IS
A GOLD MINE OF
ENTERTAINMENT.
本文是
金矿
娱乐。

12:53.306 --> 12:56.176
A SPECTACULAR
AFTERNOON OF
UNDERWATER FUN.
壮观
下午
水下乐趣。

12:56.243 --> 12:57.911
A TREASURE TROVE OF...
一个宝库...

12:57.978 --> 12:59.947
GARBAGE.
垃圾。

13:00.013 --> 13:01.348
SO YOU DON'T WANT IT?
所以你不想要它吗？

13:01.414 --> 13:03.016
RIGHT!
正确的！

13:03.083 --> 13:04.852
DOES THAT MEAN
I CAN HAVE IT?
这是否意味着
我可以拥有它吗？

13:04.852 --> 13:07.054
YES, BY ALL MEANS, TAKE IT.
是的，无论如何，接受它。

13:07.120 --> 13:08.388
( phone rings )
（电话铃声响起）

13:08.455 --> 13:09.556
HELLO.
你好。

13:09.622 --> 13:10.891
SpongeBob:
You sure?
海绵宝宝：
你确定吗？

13:10.958 --> 13:12.860
YES! FOR THE FINAL TIME
是的！最后一次

13:12.926 --> 13:14.895
I DON'T WANT THAT PAPER.
我不想要那张纸。

13:14.962 --> 13:17.330
IT'S YOURS FOREVER AND EVER!
它永远属于您！

13:17.397 --> 13:18.498
( sighs )
（叹气）

13:18.565 --> 13:20.567
ARE YOU DEFINITELY,
POSITIVELY SURE?
你确定吗？
肯定吗？

13:20.633 --> 13:21.568
GET OUT!
出去！

13:21.634 --> 13:22.569
BUT ARE...
但是……

13:22.635 --> 13:24.171
GET... OUT...!
出去...！

13:24.237 --> 13:26.739
LAST CHANCE TO CHANGE
YOUR MIND, SQUIDWARD.
最后的改变机会
你的头脑，章鱼哥。

13:26.874 --> 13:28.575
TAKE IT, SPONGEBOB.
接受它，海绵宝宝。

13:28.641 --> 13:30.243
TAKE IT, PLEASE.
请拿走。

13:30.310 --> 13:35.983
AND PROMISE ME,
NO MATTER HOW MUCH I MAY
BEG AND PLEAD AND CRY
并向我保证，
无论我可以付出多少
乞求、恳求、哭泣

13:36.049 --> 13:41.454
DON'T GIVE THAT PAPER
BACK TO ME... EVER!
不要给那张纸
回到我身边...永远！

13:41.521 --> 13:43.723
SO, I TAKE THAT
AS A POSSIBLE NO?
所以，我认为
作为可能的否？

13:43.790 --> 13:46.026
SQUIDWARD? SQUIDWARD?
SQUIDWARD?
章鱼哥？章鱼哥？
章鱼哥？

13:46.093 --> 13:49.930
OKAY, SQUIDWARD,
THAT'S A PROMISE
I'LL JUST HAVE TO KEEP.
好的，章鱼哥，
这是一个承诺
我只得保留。

13:49.997 --> 13:51.564
AH, MR. PAPER.
啊，先生。纸。

13:51.631 --> 13:54.801
I AM SO LUCKY TO HAVE
A FRIEND LIKE SQUIDWARD.
我很幸运拥有
像章鱼哥这样的朋友。

13:55.802 --> 13:57.070
SPONGEBOB...
海绵宝宝...

13:57.137 --> 13:59.572
( SpongeBob laughing )
（海绵宝宝大笑）

13:59.639 --> 14:02.375
( playing
"Mary had a Little Lamb" )
（演奏
“玛丽有一只小羊羔”）

14:02.442 --> 14:06.914
( SpongeBob laughing )
（海绵宝宝大笑）

14:06.947 --> 14:09.749
WHAT IN THE WORLD
ARE YOU GIGGLING ABOUT?
世界上有什么
你在咯咯笑吗？

14:09.816 --> 14:12.920
( laughs )
I'M SORRY, SQUIDWARD,
IT'S JUST...( giggles )
（笑）
对不起，章鱼哥，
只是……（咯咯笑）

14:12.953 --> 14:16.323
IT'S JUST THAT I'M THINKING
OF ALL THE FUN I'M GOING TO HAVE
这只是我的想法
我将享受到的所有乐趣

14:16.389 --> 14:19.492
WITH THIS PIECE
OF PAPER!
有了这件作品
纸！

14:19.559 --> 14:23.296
HOW CAN ANYONE HAVE FUN
WITH JUST A PIECE OF PAPER?
怎样才能让每个人都玩得开心
只需一张纸？

14:23.363 --> 14:25.465
( resumes playing )
（继续播放）

14:25.532 --> 14:29.937
( Spongebob laughing
and singing )
（海绵宝宝笑了
和唱歌）

14:29.937 --> 14:32.973
DOH! WHAT CAN HE POSSIBLY
BE DOING WITH THAT PAPER?
卫生部！他能做什么
正在处理那张纸吗？

14:33.040 --> 14:36.243
* LA-LA-LA-LA, LA-LA-LA-LA... *
* 拉-拉-拉-拉，拉-拉-拉-拉... *

14:36.309 --> 14:37.644
GARY, WATCH THIS.
加里，看这个。

14:39.646 --> 14:40.680
GUESS WHAT I AM?
猜猜我是什么？

14:40.747 --> 14:41.481
( meows )
（喵）

14:41.548 --> 14:42.749
WELL, YES, GARY
嗯，是的，加里

14:42.815 --> 14:46.086
I AM A SPONGE WITH PAPER
STUCK IN HIS PANTS
我是海绵与纸
卡在裤子里

14:46.153 --> 14:49.522
BUT I'M ALSO SUPER SPONGE
SOAKING UP CRIME.
但我也是超级海绵
吸收犯罪。

14:49.589 --> 14:51.591
SEE, HERE'S MY CAPE.
看，这是我的斗篷。

14:53.260 --> 14:55.062
SUPER MORON'S MORE LIKE IT.
超级白痴更喜欢它。

14:55.128 --> 14:59.332
NOW I'M SPONGEBOB JUNGLEPANTS.
现在我是海绵宝宝。

14:59.399 --> 15:00.968
( yelling
like Tarzan )
（大喊大叫
像泰山）

15:00.968 --> 15:01.969
OH, BOY.
哦，男孩。

15:01.969 --> 15:04.337
( continues yelling... )
（继续大喊……）

15:04.404 --> 15:09.376
UGH... SPONGEBOB JUNGLEPANTS
SUMMON ANIMAL FRIENDS.
呃……海绵宝宝丛林裤
召唤动物朋友。

15:09.442 --> 15:11.444
( roaring )
（咆哮）

15:11.511 --> 15:12.980
( cawing )
（叫声）

15:12.980 --> 15:14.314
( blows raspberry )
（吹覆盆子）

15:14.381 --> 15:15.315
( screeching )
（尖叫声）

15:15.382 --> 15:17.985
( imitating foghorn )
（模仿雾号）

15:17.985 --> 15:20.053
( chattering )
（喋喋不休）

15:20.120 --> 15:21.989
( barking )
（吠叫）

15:21.989 --> 15:22.755
( meows )
（喵）

15:22.822 --> 15:24.091
YOU'RE RIGHT, GARY
你是对的，加里

15:24.157 --> 15:25.658
I'M NOT A JUNGLE BOY.
我不是丛林男孩。

15:25.725 --> 15:28.128
I AM A BOX OF ARMY SUPPLIES
我是一箱军需物资

15:28.195 --> 15:31.298
BRINGING RELIEF
TO THE HUNGRY TROOPS!
带来救济
致饥饿的军队！

15:33.000 --> 15:36.336
LANDING JUST IN TIME
FOR... THE BULLFIGHT!
准时着陆
为了...斗牛！

15:36.403 --> 15:38.171
TORO! TORO, GARY!
托罗！托罗，加里！

15:38.238 --> 15:41.774
TORO, TORO!
TORO... GARY.
TORO...
托罗，托罗！
托罗...加里。
托罗...

15:41.841 --> 15:43.076
HEY, OLE!
嘿，奥莱！

15:43.143 --> 15:44.244
( crowd cheers )
（人群欢呼）

15:44.311 --> 15:45.578
NOW, FOR SOME IMPRESSIONS.
现在，留下一些印象。

15:45.645 --> 15:47.380
A GUY WITH A MUSTACHE.
一个留着小胡子的家伙。

15:47.447 --> 15:50.417
LOOK AT ME,
I'M A GUY WITH A MUSTACHE.
看看我，
我是一个留着小胡子的人。

15:50.483 --> 15:52.919
A PIRATE WITH AN EYE PATCH.
带眼罩的海盗。

15:53.020 --> 15:54.854
ARR, I'M A PIRATE.
啊，我是海盗。

15:54.921 --> 15:56.756
A REGULAR GUY WITH AN EYE PATCH.
一个戴着眼罩的普通人。

15:56.823 --> 15:59.092
ARR, I AM NOT A PIRATE.
ARR，我不是海盗。

15:59.159 --> 16:02.395
DO A BIG YELLOW IDIOT WITH
A STUPID PIECE OF PAPER.
做一个大黄白痴
一张愚蠢的纸。

16:13.840 --> 16:15.108
HOW DID HE DO THAT?
他是怎么做到的？

16:15.175 --> 16:18.078
LOOK, GARY, ORAL-GAMI.
看，加里，口头-GAMI。

16:19.079 --> 16:21.048
Children:
BIRD! YAY!
儿童：
鸟！耶！

16:22.349 --> 16:24.384
SNOWFLAKE! YAY!
雪花！耶！

16:25.718 --> 16:28.055
PAPER DOLL, YAY!
纸娃娃，耶！

16:28.121 --> 16:31.391
HEY, THAT LITTLE PAPER
DOES SEEM LIKE FUN.
嘿，那张小纸
看起来确实很有趣。

16:31.458 --> 16:32.825
WHAT AM I SAYING?!
我在说什么？

16:32.892 --> 16:35.528
I AM SUCH AN IDIOT.
我真是个白痴。

16:35.595 --> 16:37.064
( laughs )
（笑）

16:37.064 --> 16:41.634
SPONGEBOB, HONESTLY,
AND HIS DUMB PAPER.
海绵宝宝，老实说，
还有他的蠢纸。

16:41.701 --> 16:43.303
HE CALLS THAT FUN?
他说这很有趣？

16:43.370 --> 16:46.273
NOW, READING
BORING SCIENCE DIGEST,
THAT'S FUN.
现在，阅读
无聊的科学文摘，
这很有趣。

16:46.339 --> 16:48.141
( muttering )
（嘀咕）

16:48.208 --> 16:50.577
( laughs )
CHECK EROSION!
（笑）
检查侵蚀！

16:50.643 --> 16:53.313
( laughs )
MITOSIS!
（笑）
有丝分裂！

16:53.380 --> 16:59.419
( SpongeBob laughing )
（海绵宝宝大笑）

16:59.486 --> 17:02.255
SEE, I CAN HAVE FUN
TAKING A BATH.
看，我可以玩得开心
洗澡。

17:02.322 --> 17:06.093
( Spongebob making
airplane noise )
（海绵宝宝制作
飞机噪音）

17:06.093 --> 17:08.195
( imitating machine gun )
（仿机枪）

17:08.261 --> 17:10.563
( rubber duck squeaking )
（橡皮鸭吱吱叫）

17:10.630 --> 17:13.733
PAINTING FRUIT--
THERE'S NOTHING MORE FUN
THAN PAINTING FRUIT.
画水果--
没有什么比这更有趣的了
比画水果。

17:13.800 --> 17:15.668
THIS IS MORE FUN THAN ANYTHING.
这比任何事情都有趣。

17:15.735 --> 17:21.574
( Spongebob laughing )
（海绵宝宝大笑）

17:21.641 --> 17:22.742
( gasps )
（喘气）

17:22.809 --> 17:24.111
( Spongebob laughing )
（海绵宝宝大笑）

17:24.111 --> 17:26.012
OH...! ( grumbling )
哦...！ （抱怨）

17:26.113 --> 17:29.182
( yelling )
（大喊）

17:29.249 --> 17:31.118
( coughing and panting )
（咳嗽、气喘吁吁）

17:31.118 --> 17:33.620
( SpongeBob laughing )
（海绵宝宝大笑）

17:33.686 --> 17:36.756
I'LL PROVE TO HIM
THAT PAPER IS NOT FUN!
我会向他证明
那篇论文一点也不有趣！

17:37.924 --> 17:39.526
( whistling )
（吹口哨）

17:39.592 --> 17:41.594
* I'M HAVING FUN, LA-LA-LA. *
* 我玩得很开心，啦啦啦。 *

17:41.661 --> 17:43.996
* ISN'T IT GREAT,
LA-LA-LA-LA-LA *
* 这不是很棒吗，
拉-拉-拉-拉-拉 *

17:44.131 --> 17:45.165
* LA-LA *
* 洛杉矶-洛杉矶 *

17:45.232 --> 17:46.699
* LA-LA-LA-LA... *
* 拉-拉-拉-拉... *

17:46.766 --> 17:48.368
OKAY, SPONGEBOB,
TOP THIS ONE.
好吧，海绵宝宝，
顶这个。

17:48.435 --> 17:52.539
HEY, LITTLE SQUIDWARD,
WHAT'S GRAY AND UGLY
AND HAS SIX ARMS?
嘿，小章鱼哥，
什么是灰色和丑陋的
有六只手臂？

17:52.605 --> 17:55.942
I DON'T KNOW,
BUT HAVE YOU LOOKED
IN THE MIRROR LATELY?
我不知道，
但你看过吗
最近在镜子里吗？

17:56.008 --> 17:57.144
WHAT? WHY YOU...
什么？为什么你...

17:57.177 --> 17:58.545
( laughing )
（笑）

17:58.611 --> 18:01.614
OH, THAT'S A GOOD ONE,
SQUIDWARD, NOW LET ME TRY.
哦，这是一个很好的，
章鱼哥，现在让我试试。

18:01.681 --> 18:03.750
HAVE YOU HEARD
ANY GOOD JOKES, MR. PAPER?
你听说过吗
有什么好笑话吗，先生。纸？

18:03.816 --> 18:06.419
WHAT HAPPENED TO THE PAPER
THAT FELL IN THE OCEAN?
论文发生了什么
那掉进海里了？

18:06.486 --> 18:09.789
I DON'T KNOW, WHAT HAPPENED
TO THE PAPER THAT FELL
IN THE OCEAN?
我不知道发生了什么
到掉落的纸
在海洋中？

18:09.856 --> 18:11.658
IT WAS ALL WASHED-UP.
一切都被冲走了。

18:11.724 --> 18:15.262
( crowd laughing )
（众人大笑）

18:15.328 --> 18:17.630
LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA...
拉-拉-拉-拉-拉-拉-拉...

18:17.697 --> 18:21.968
HA, HA, I'M HAVING SO MUCH FUN
WITH MY NEW SHELL CART.
哈哈哈，我玩得很开心
带着我的新贝壳车。

18:22.034 --> 18:23.303
AH, HA, HA.
啊，哈，哈。

18:23.370 --> 18:27.174
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
CAN YOUR STUPID PAPER DO THIS?
嘿，海绵宝宝，
你的愚蠢论文能做到这一点吗？

18:27.240 --> 18:28.441
( helicopter engine )
（直升机发动机）

18:28.508 --> 18:30.277
NOPE.
没有。

18:33.313 --> 18:36.183
WELL, YOU CAN'T PLAY MUSIC
WITH A PIECE OF PAPER!
好吧，你不能播放音乐
用一张纸！

18:36.183 --> 18:41.354
( playing "Mary Had a
Little Lamb" off-key )
（播放“玛丽有一个
小羊羔走调）

18:41.421 --> 18:42.755
HOORAY! HOORAY!
万岁！万岁！

18:42.822 --> 18:44.424
THAT WAS GREAT,
SQUIDWARD.
太棒了，
章鱼哥。

18:44.491 --> 18:46.393
ALL THOSE WRONG NOTES
YOU PLAYED
所有那些错误的笔记
你玩过

18:46.459 --> 18:48.195
MADE IT SOUND
MORE ORIGINAL.
让它听起来
更原创。

18:48.228 --> 18:50.830
WHAT? I DIDN'T PLAY
ANY WRONG NOTES.
什么？我没玩
任何错误的注释。

18:50.897 --> 18:52.199
( plays off-key )
（演奏走调）

18:52.199 --> 18:55.202
YEAH, SEE, YOU'RE
PLAYING IT LIKE THIS...
是的，看，你是
像这样玩...

18:55.268 --> 18:56.503
( plays off-key )
（演奏走调）

18:56.569 --> 18:59.206
WHEN ORDINARILY
IT GOES LIKE THIS...
一般情况下
事情是这样的……

18:59.272 --> 19:00.673
( plays perfectly )
（完美播放）

19:00.740 --> 19:03.610
I'M PARTIAL TO DOING IT
IN THE KEY OF A-MINOR, MYSELF.
我偏爱这样做
A小调，我自己。

19:03.676 --> 19:09.316
( playing jazzy version
in higher key... )
（演奏爵士版本
调高调...)

19:12.652 --> 19:15.888
AH, NOTHING LIKE
A DUET BETWEEN BUDDIES,
EH, SQUIDWARD?
啊，一点也不像
好友之间的二重唱，
呃，章鱼哥？

19:15.955 --> 19:17.390
GIVE ME MY PAPER BACK!
把我的论文还给我！

19:17.457 --> 19:18.991
NOW LET GO OF IT.
现在放手吧。

19:19.058 --> 19:20.693
I SAID LET GO OF IT!
我说放手吧！

19:20.760 --> 19:22.862
LET GO, LET GO, LET GO...
放开，放开，放开……

19:22.929 --> 19:24.030
I CAN'T!
我不能！

19:24.096 --> 19:25.698
WHAT DO YOU MEAN
YOU CAN'T?
你是什么意思
你不能吗？

19:25.765 --> 19:26.699
I CAN'T!
我不能！

19:26.766 --> 19:28.235
YOU MADE ME PROMISE
你让我承诺

19:28.235 --> 19:31.238
NO MATTER HOW MUCH YOU
BEGGED AND PLEADED AND CRIED
无论你有多少
哀求、恳求、哭泣

19:31.304 --> 19:33.640
NOT TO GIVE THE PAPER
BACK TO YOU EVER.
不提供文件
回到你身边。

19:33.706 --> 19:35.642
I NEVER SAID ANYTHING LIKE THAT.
我从来没有说过这样的话。

19:35.708 --> 19:38.545
SURE YOU DID, SQUIDWARD, LOOK.
你当然知道了，章鱼哥，看。

19:38.611 --> 19:40.247
TAKE IT SPONGEBOB.
拿走海绵宝宝吧。

19:40.247 --> 19:41.914
TAKE IT, PLEASE.
请拿走。

19:41.981 --> 19:48.788
AND PROMISE ME,
NO MATTER HOW MUCH
I MAY BEG AND PLEAD AND CRY
并向我保证，
无论多少钱
我可能会哀求、恳求、哭泣

19:48.855 --> 19:53.560
DON'T GIVE THAT PAPER
BACK TO ME... EVER!
不要给那张纸
回到我身边...永远！

19:53.626 --> 19:54.794
WANT TO SEE IT AGAIN?
想再看一遍吗？

19:54.861 --> 19:56.596
NO, I DON'T WANT
TO SEE IT AGAIN.
不，我不想
再次看到它。

19:56.663 --> 19:57.930
JUST GIVE ME THAT PAPER.
把那张纸给我。

19:57.997 --> 20:00.267
SORRY, SQUIDWARD,
I AM SWORN TO
A PROMISE.
对不起，章鱼哥，
我宣誓
一个承诺。

20:00.267 --> 20:01.568
MAYBE I SHOULD
GET GOING.
也许我应该
开始吧。

20:01.634 --> 20:04.070
WAIT, WAIT, MAYBE WE CAN
TRADE FOR SOMETHING.
等等，等等，也许我们可以
交易某物。

20:04.136 --> 20:05.605
YEAH, SOMETHING, SOMETHING.
是啊，有什么，有什么。

20:05.672 --> 20:07.073
AH... WAIT UP, SPONGEBOB.
啊……等等，海绵宝宝。

20:07.139 --> 20:09.809
WAIT! HOLD ON THERE,
CHUM. ( laughs )
等待！坚持住，
密友。 （笑）

20:09.876 --> 20:12.245
I'M GOING TO MAKE YOU AN OFFER.
我要给你一个报价。

20:12.312 --> 20:14.614
WOW! POCKET LINT!
哇！口袋里的绒毛！

20:14.681 --> 20:16.949
YOU DRIVE A HARD BARGAIN,
SQUIDWARD.
你进行艰难的讨价还价，
章鱼哥。

20:17.016 --> 20:19.252
PAPER FOR LINT,
HMM...
棉绒纸，
嗯……

20:19.319 --> 20:20.987
NOT THE LINT,
THE RUBBER BAND.
不是棉绒，
橡皮筋。

20:21.053 --> 20:22.154
THE RUBBER BAND?
橡皮筋？

20:22.221 --> 20:24.190
DO I DARE?
我敢吗？

20:24.257 --> 20:26.259
OH... DARE! DARE!
哦...敢！敢！

20:26.326 --> 20:28.961
OKA... OH, I GET IT.
好吧……哦，我明白了。

20:29.028 --> 20:32.098
YOU'RE JUST TESTING ME.
你只是在考验我。

20:32.164 --> 20:34.334
DON'T WORRY, SQUIDWARD,
I WON'T LET YOU DOWN.
别担心，章鱼哥，
我不会让你失望的。

20:34.401 --> 20:36.002
A PROMISE
IS A PROMISE.
一个承诺
是一个承诺。

20:36.068 --> 20:37.337
LISTEN, YOU.
听着，你。

20:37.404 --> 20:40.640
YOU ARE NOT GOING ANYWHERE
UNTIL WE STRIKE A DEAL.
你哪儿也不去
直到我们达成协议。

20:40.707 --> 20:44.243
GOT TO GET THAT... PAPER.
必须拿到……纸。

20:44.311 --> 20:45.845
SQUIDWARD?
章鱼哥？

20:45.912 --> 20:47.246
TRADE...
贸易...

20:48.648 --> 20:49.749
HEY, LISTEN.
嘿，听着。

20:49.816 --> 20:52.819
EVERYTHING MUST... GO!
一切都必须......去！

20:52.885 --> 20:54.854
WELL, THAT'S THE LAST OF IT.
好了，这就是最后的了。

20:54.921 --> 20:58.391
I'VE GIVEN YOU EVERYTHING
BUT THE SHIRT OFF MY BACK.
我已经给了你一切
但我把衬衫脱下来了。

21:01.093 --> 21:04.731
OH... SQUIDWARD, IS THIS
STILL PART OF THE TEST?
哦……章鱼哥，这是这个吗
仍然是测试的一部分吗？

21:04.797 --> 21:07.467
BECAUSE IT'S...
IT'S REALLY GETTING
因为它是...
真的越来越

21:07.534 --> 21:10.403
HARDER AND HARDER
TO KEEP MY PROMISE.
越来越难
信守承诺。

21:10.470 --> 21:11.904
OKAY, THE SHIRT!
好的，衬衫！

21:13.340 --> 21:15.442
TAKE IT, TAKE MY SHIRT!
拿走它，拿走我的衬衫！

21:15.508 --> 21:17.377
SQUIDWARD'S SHIRT.
章鱼哥的衬衫。

21:17.444 --> 21:20.413
I... I'VE ALWAYS
LOVED THAT SHIRT.
我...我一直都是
喜欢那件衬衫。

21:20.480 --> 21:23.516
OKAY, OKAY, I'LL TRADE!
好吧，好吧，我会交易！

21:23.583 --> 21:25.352
I CAN BREAK A PROMISE
FOR THIS.
我可以违背诺言
为此。

21:25.418 --> 21:27.854
SQUIDWARD, DO YOU WANT
YOUR OTHER STUFF?
章鱼哥，你想要吗
你的其他东西？

21:27.920 --> 21:29.656
'CAUSE THIS IS
ALL I'LL NEED.
因为这是
我需要的一切。

21:29.722 --> 21:32.459
YOU CAN HAVE ALL THAT JUNK,
BECAUSE NOW I'VE GOT THIS.
你可以拥有所有这些垃圾，
因为现在我得到了这个。

21:32.525 --> 21:35.462
I'VE GOT THE PAPER, AND
YOU'VE GOT MY USELESS GARBAGE.
我拿到了纸，并且
你得到的是我无用的垃圾。

21:35.528 --> 21:37.163
I GOT IT! HA, HA, HA.
我得到了它！哈，哈，哈。

21:37.229 --> 21:38.465
YOU CAN'T HAVE IT.
你不能拥有它。

21:38.531 --> 21:40.367
I GOT IT,
YOU'RE A SUCKER.
我明白了，
你真是个傻瓜。

21:40.367 --> 21:41.468
YOU'RE A SUCKER.
你真是个傻瓜。

21:41.534 --> 21:42.902
( laughs ) AT LAST.
（笑）终于。

21:42.969 --> 21:45.638
WHAT SHOULD WE TRY FIRST,
MR. PAPER? IMPRESSIONS!
我们应该先尝试什么，
先生。纸？印象！

21:45.705 --> 21:47.840
A GUY WITH A PIECE OF PAPER
ON HIS NOSE.
一个拿着一张纸的人
在他的鼻子上。

21:47.907 --> 21:50.510
LOOK AT ME, I'M A GUY WITH
A PIECE OF PAPER...
看看我，我是个男人
一张纸...

21:50.577 --> 21:54.146
ON HIS... NOSE.
在他的……鼻子上。

21:54.213 --> 21:56.383
HMM... AHA!
嗯...啊哈！

21:56.416 --> 21:57.717
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT.
等等，等等，等等。

21:59.986 --> 22:00.920
TA-DA!
达达！

22:00.987 --> 22:03.856
Children:
BOO!
儿童：
嘘！

22:05.858 --> 22:07.960
OKAY, OKAY, UH... HELICOPTER!
好吧，好吧，呃……直升机！

22:08.027 --> 22:11.431
GENTLEMEN, START YOUR ENGINES.
先生们，启动你们的引擎。

22:11.498 --> 22:13.766
I'M FLYING!
我在飞！

22:13.833 --> 22:16.536
OH, YEAH, I'M FLYING!
哦，是的，我要飞了！

22:16.603 --> 22:18.037
I'M FLYING!
我在飞！

22:18.104 --> 22:20.272
THAT'S RIGHT, THAT'S RIGHT,
HERE WE GO NOW.
没错，没错，
现在我们开始吧。

22:20.407 --> 22:23.042
I'M FLYING, FLYING, FLYING,
FLYING, FLYING, FLYING...
我飞翔，飞翔，飞翔，
飞，飞，飞……

22:23.109 --> 22:24.444
( wheezing ):
FLYING...
（喘息）：
飞行...

22:24.511 --> 22:27.113
( clarinet squeaking... )
（单簧管吱吱作响……）

22:37.189 --> 22:40.627
WAIT, MORE IMPRESSIONS.
等等，更多印象。

22:40.693 --> 22:44.864
A GUY THROWING A PIECE OF PAPER
ON THE GROUND!
一个人扔了一张纸
在地面上！

22:44.931 --> 22:49.201
A GUY STOMPING
ON THE PIECE OF PAPER!
一个人跺脚
在纸上！

22:49.268 --> 22:52.905
I'M A GUY WHO TRADED
EVERYTHING HE OWNS FOR...
我是一个从事交易的人
他拥有的一切都是为了……

22:52.972 --> 22:56.108
A WORTHLESS
PIECE OF PAPER.
一文不值
一张纸。

22:56.175 --> 22:58.945
HEY, THANKS, IT'S JUST
WHAT I NEEDED, SQUIDWARD.
嘿，谢谢，这只是
我需要什么，章鱼哥。

22:59.011 --> 23:00.246
( chewing )
（咀嚼）

23:07.720 --> 23:10.122
NICE SHIRT, SPONGEBOB.
( chuckles )
海绵宝宝，衬衫不错。
（笑声）

23:10.189 --> 23:12.592
( wind blowing )
（风吹）

23:12.659 --> 23:20.867
ANYBODY HAVE ANY SUNSCREEN?
有人有防晒霜吗？

23:20.933 --> 23:23.102
